  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Roy James Carver built Bandag into an international tyre-retreading business from his base in Muscatine, Iowa. A University of Illinois graduate, he had earlier founded Carver Pump with his brother Ralph during the Depression. Wartime orders from Allied navies helped establish the pump business that preceded his success in the tyre industry.",
    "html": "<p>Roy James Carver built Bandag into an international tyre-retreading business from his base in Muscatine, Iowa. A University of Illinois graduate, he had earlier founded Carver Pump with his brother Ralph during the Depression. Wartime orders from Allied navies helped establish the pump business that preceded his success in the tyre industry.</p>\r\n",
    "word_count": 52,
